      "message": "txgraph: add GetMainOrder\n\nReturn all transactions in the main graph in the order of\nCompareMainOrder by walking the chunk index, without comparing\ntransactions. The unit test and the fuzz test check that it matches the\norder of a BlockBuilder that skips nothing, and the fuzz test also\nchecks the order implied by CompareMainOrder.",
