      "message": "txmempool: get main order from TxGraph::GetMainOrder\n\nGetSortedScoreWithTopology() sorted all entries with\nTxGraph::CompareMainOrder, which does pairwise comparisons across\nclusters. Ask the TxGraph for the main order instead, which it already\nhas in its chunk index. check() keeps the comparison sort as a\nreference and asserts that both orders agree.",
